===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[adrenal]] [[gland]]}}

# {{anatomy}} In [[mammal]]s, either of a pair of complex [[endocrine gland]]s, situated above each [[kidney]], secreting [[hormone]]s which control the [[heart rate]], [[blood pressure]], and [[metabolism]].

